OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fisolated through the evening, before
OL,7,Fturning frequent and occasionally
OL,8,Fheavy overnight, bringing the risk of
OL,9,Fhail and thunder as south to southwest
OL,10,Fwinds increasing fresh to strong.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FSharp showers at first, soon
OL,13,Fdwindling to leave a mainly dry day of
OL,14,Fsunny spells. Fresh southwest winds
OL,15,Fbacking to the south for the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
